      <!-- Detailed Review: BirkyStudio -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:32px;">Detailed Review</h2>

      <div id="birky-studio" style="background:rgba(129,140,248,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(129,140,248,0.3);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <span style="background:#818cf8;color:white;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">BEST FOR REAL ESTATE</span>
          <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0;">BirkyStudio</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio builds professional websites for real estate agents — done for you, not by you. You provide your content, branding preferences, and any specific features you need (IDX integration, property search, lead capture, blog), and Luna builds the site in 5-7 days. The result is a custom website that looks professional, converts visitors into leads, and includes an AI receptionist that answers calls and WhatsApp messages 24/7.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          The key advantage is that you don't spend a single hour building it. No templates to customize, no SEO plugins to configure, no mobile responsiveness to test. Luna, a licensed real estate agent who owns Antigua Real Estate Development, builds sites that understand how real estate agents actually work — with property search, lead capture, and AI-powered follow-up built in from day one. It's the difference between buying Ikea furniture and having a carpenter build it for you.
        </p>
