              <li>Zero time investment — you provide content, they build the site</li>
              <li>One-time payment, no recurring subscription fees</li>
              <li>IDX/MLS integration built in</li>
              <li>AI receptionist included with lead capture</li>
              <li>Built by a realtor who knows the industry</li>
              <li>SEO done for you</li>
              <li>Over 3 years, 50-80% cheaper than subscription builders</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ Cons</p>
            <ul style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
